Axium : Q. Axius, whom Cicero
mentions in several letters. See ad Att. 3. 15; 4. 15; 5. 21;
12. I.-

Recensum populi : i.e., with reference to the distribution of corn,
as appears from what follows. Cf. Appian. Bell. Civ. 2. 120.;
Plutarch, Pomp. 50.-

